; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: system-ui; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: -0.3px; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: system-ui; font-size: 14pt; letter-spacing: -0.3px;\">&nbsp; 3) 협력 기업 소개 및 취업 기회 제공</span><br style=\"box-sizing: initial; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: system-ui; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: -0.3px; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: system-ui; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: -0.3px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">○</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: initial; font-weight: bolder; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: system-ui; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: -0.3px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: initial; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 1.5; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">신청 기간: 2024. 2. 26.(월) ~ 3. 8.(금)</span></span><br style=\"box-sizing: initial; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: system-ui; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: -0.3px; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: system-ui; font-size: 14pt; letter-spacing: -0.3px;\">○ 교육 신청 방법: 온라인 신청 (</span><a href=\"https://academy.idec.or.kr/track/apply/list/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration-line